Meta.documentation:httpServer
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:A low-level HTTP listener resource: the express-minimal primitive
Meta.documentation:an express: scheme can later be layered on top of.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:httpServer:port listens; port 0 picks an ephemeral port and prints it.
Meta.documentation:Per accepted request it fires out_request_headers first (method, url,
Meta.documentation:headers), then out_request_<Type> with the request body cast through the
Meta.documentation:Content-Type tree (out_request_octetstream is the fallback). The handler
Meta.documentation:chain return value becomes the response, cast back through the tree;
Meta.documentation:undefined means 204. Unbound requests answer 404.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_headers - request meta, fired before any body port
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_octetstream - body fallback, binary cast of the request body
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_String - String body (text/* content-type)
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_Data - Data body (application/json content-type)
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:%2F%2F%20httpServer%3Aport%20%E2%80%94%20a%20low-level%20HTTP%20listener%20resource%20(the%20Express-minimal%0A%2F%2F%20primitive%20an%20express%3A%20scheme%20can%20later%20be%20layered%20on%20top%20of).%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20Per%20accepted%20request%20it%20fires%2C%20in%20order%3A%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20out_request_headers%20%20%20%E2%80%94%20%7B%20method%2C%20url%2C%20headers%20%7D%20as%20Data%2C%20always%20if%20bound%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20out_request_%3CType%3E%20%20%20%20%E2%80%94%20the%20request%20body%20cast%20through%20the%20Content-Type%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tree%20(out_request_octetstream%20is%20the%20fallback)%0A%2F%2F%20The%20handler%20chain's%20return%20value%20becomes%20the%20response%3A%20cast%20back%20through%0A%2F%2F%20the%20tree%20(String%2FNumber%2FBoolean%20%E2%86%92%20text%2Fplain%2C%20Data%2FList%20%E2%86%92%20application%2Fjson%2C%0A%2F%2F%20octetstream%20%E2%86%92%20application%2Foctetstream).%20undefined%20means%20204%20(empty).%0A%2F%2F%20If%20nothing%20is%20bound%20for%20the%20request%20at%20all%2C%20the%20answer%20is%20404.%0Aconst%20Resource%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0Aconst%20http%20%3D%20require(%22node%3Ahttp%22)%3B%0Aconst%20castLib%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Scheme%2Fcast%22)%3B%0Aconst%20StringRes%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FString%22)%3B%0A%0Afunction%20httpServer()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22httpServer%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20httpServerProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20httpServerProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%0A%09let%20server%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09let%20started%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%09%2F%2F%20serialize%20request%20handling%3A%20flows%20run%20one%20at%20a%20time%2C%20in%20accept%20order%0A%09let%20tail%20%3D%20Promise.resolve()%3B%0A%0A%09this.out_request_headers%20%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_request_octetstream%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_request_String%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_request_Data%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09newObject.port%20%3D%20parseInt(decodeURIComponent(input.value%20%7C%7C%20%22%22))%20%7C%7C%200%3B%20%2F%2F%200%20%3D%20ephemeral%0A%09%09return%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_go%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(started)%20return%3B%0A%09%09started%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09const%20self%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%09%09server%20%3D%20http.createServer(function(req%2C%20res)%20%7B%0A%09%09%09tail%20%3D%20tail.then(function()%20%7B%20return%20self.handle(req%2C%20res)%3B%20%7D)%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.catch(function(err)%20%7B%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%09console.log(%22httpServer%20handler%20error%3A%20%22%20%2B%20(err%20%26%26%20err.message))%3B%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%09if%20(!res.headersSent)%20%7B%20res.statusCode%20%3D%20500%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%09res.end(%22httpServer%3A%20500%20internal%20error%22)%3B%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%7D)%3B%0A%09%09server.listen(resource.port%2C%20function()%20%7B%0A%09%09%09console.log(%22httpServer%20listening%20on%20port%20%22%20%2B%20(server.address()%20%3F%20server.address().port%20%3A%20resource.port))%3B%0A%09%09%7D)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.handle%20%3D%20async%20function(req%2C%20res)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09const%20chunks%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09req.on(%22data%22%2C%20c%20%3D%3E%20chunks.push(c))%3B%0A%09%09await%20new%20Promise(function(done)%20%7B%20req.on(%22end%22%2C%20done)%3B%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09const%20body%20%3D%20Buffer.concat(chunks)%3B%0A%0A%09%09const%20meta%20%3D%20%7B%20method%3A%20req.method%2C%20url%3A%20req.url%2C%20headers%3A%20req.headers%20%7D%3B%0A%09%09const%20contentType%20%3D%20(req.headers%5B%22content-type%22%5D%20%7C%7C%20%22%22).split(%22%3B%22)%5B0%5D%3B%0A%09%09const%20value%20%3D%20await%20castLib.cast(contentType%2C%20body%2C%20req.url)%3B%0A%0A%09%09const%20self%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%09%09let%20reply%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%201.%20headers%20port%20fires%20first%20%E2%80%94%20routing%20sees%20method%2Furl%20before%20the%20body%0A%09%09if%20(self.out_request_headers)%0A%09%09%09reply%20%3D%20await%20self.out_request_headers(meta)%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%202.%20typed%20body%20port%20%E2%80%94%20out_request_octetstream%20is%20the%20fallback%20(cast%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20%20%20%20guarantees%20an%20octetstream%20when%20nothing%20more%20specific%20exists)%0A%09%09if%20(value)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09const%20bodyPort%20%3D%20self%5B%22out_request_%22%20%2B%20value.get_resource().name%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(bodyPort)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09const%20bodyReply%20%3D%20await%20bodyPort(value)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09if%20(bodyReply%20!%3D%3D%20undefined)%20reply%20%3D%20bodyReply%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09if%20(reply%20%3D%3D%3D%20undefined%20%26%26%20!self.out_request_headers%20%26%26%20!value)%0A%09%09%09return%20respond(res%2C%20undefined%2C%20404)%3B%0A%0A%09%09respond(res%2C%20reply%2C%20undefined)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20anything%20the%20handler%20chain%20returned%20%E2%86%92%20response%20on%20the%20wire%0A%09function%20respond(res%2C%20reply%2C%20status)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(reply%20%3D%3D%3D%20undefined%20%7C%7C%20reply%20%3D%3D%3D%20null)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09res.statusCode%20%3D%20status%20%7C%7C%20204%3B%0A%09%09%09res.end()%3B%0A%09%09%09return%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09if%20(reply.get_resource)%20%2F%2F%20a%20resource%3A%20cast%20by%20its%20type%20name%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09const%20r%20%3D%20reply.get_resource()%3B%0A%09%09%09const%20v%20%3D%20r.value%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22String%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Number%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Boolean%22)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20String(v))%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Data%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22List%22)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%20JSON.stringify(v%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20v%20%3A%20(r.elements%20%7C%7C%20%5B%5D)))%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22octetstream%22)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Foctet-stream%22%2C%20Buffer.from(v%20instanceof%20Uint8Array%20%3F%20v%20%3A%20new%20Uint8Array(0)))%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20String(v))%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09switch%20(typeof%20reply)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09case%20%22string%22%3A%20%20return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20reply)%3B%0A%09%09%09case%20%22number%22%3A%0A%09%09%09case%20%22boolean%22%3A%20return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20String(reply))%3B%0A%09%09%09case%20%22object%22%3A%0A%09%09%09%09if%20(reply%20instanceof%20Uint8Array)%0A%09%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Foctet-stream%22%2C%20Buffer.from(reply))%3B%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%20JSON.stringify(reply))%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C204%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20%22%22)%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09function%20send(res%2C%20status%2C%20contentType%2C%20body)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09res.statusCode%20%3D%20status%3B%0A%09%09res.setHeader(%22content-type%22%2C%20contentType)%3B%0A%09%09res.end(body)%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0AhttpServer.Processor%20%3D%20httpServerProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%20%3D%20httpServer%3B]>>NewResource:httpServer